The OMG normative metamodel
===========================

`src/generated.rs` is written by the generator in this crate from the
normative machine-readable metamodel the Object Management Group
publishes with the specifications:

    KerML 1.0   https://www.omg.org/spec/KerML/20250201/KerML.xmi
    SysML 2.0   https://www.omg.org/spec/SysML/20250201/SysML.xmi

Most of what it carries is derived -- metaclass names, their inheritance,
the shape of each property. Some of it is the specification's own text,
reproduced unchanged so that this crate can state and evaluate what the
specification requires:

  * the OCL body of each of the 180 constraints, 235 derivations and 99
    operations it states (`RULES`, `DERIVATIONS`, `OPERATIONS`), about
    65,000 characters
  * the sentence each constraint and derivation states in words
    (`Rule::says`), about 42,000

